    SK7 -->|sqlite3| HOMEDB
    SKSG -->|list/get_style_guide| Stdio
    WEB -->|HTTPS| Http
    MCPR -->|spawns + proxies| Stdio
    LIGHT -->|reads directly| DB
    Queries --> DB
    DB -.->|packaged| HOMEDB
